A '''hyperlane''' ran through the [[Mid Rim Territories]], linking the [[Rimma Trade Route]] with a [[Karfeddion–Eriadu hyperlane|smaller hyperlane]] that connected [[Eriadu]] with [[Karfeddion]]. The [[Eiattu system]] and [[Taltos]] were both located along the route.<ref name="AVG" />

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, this route was known as the [[Ado Spine]], and originated in the [[1997]] [[West End Games]] sourcebook ''[[Pirates & Privateers]]''.<ref name="P&P">''[[Pirates & Privateers]]''</ref>

